## FINAL MUST-PASS CHECKLIST

- [ ] Subject normalized with aliases and exclusions where needed
- [ ] Query plan covers subject type; drift documented if narrowed
- [ ] Every factual claim in downstream text traceable to evidence or labeled as inference
- [ ] Published/updated timestamps captured when available for recency pipeline
- [ ] Source policy explicit (no hidden “whole web” assumption)
- [ ] OPSEC and connector ToS constraints respected
- [ ] Internal run JSON matches `templar.market-research.deepsearch-research-run.v1`
